Prices json output: total sale display rounds ties to even.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight prices --format json

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity ZEBRA
  format 1000 ZEBRA
commodity ALPHA
  format 1000 ALPHA
commodity Long_Fund_Name
  format 1000 Long_Fund_Name
commodity UNUSED
  format 1000 UNUSED
account Assets:Funds
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening
account Income:Gains

2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Funds  128 ALPHA {{1 SEK}}
  Assets:Cash  -1 SEK

2024-01-02 Sale
  Assets:Funds  -128 ALPHA {{1 SEK}} @@ 1 SEK
  Assets:Cash  1 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "date": "2024-01-01",
    "baseCommodity": "ALPHA",
    "quoteQuantity": "0.0078125",
    "quoteCommodity": "SEK",
    "comment": null
  },
  {
    "date": "2024-01-02",
    "baseCommodity": "ALPHA",
    "quoteQuantity": "0.0078125",
    "quoteCommodity": "SEK",
    "comment": null
  }
]
